SHORT_HELP = r'''A grep-like tool which understands source code syntax and allows for manipulation in
addition to search

Usage: executable [OPTIONS] [SCOPE] [-- <REPLACEMENT>]

Arguments:
  [SCOPE]  Scope to apply to, as a regular expression pattern. [default: .*]

Options:
